- `demote` (`host.cljc:148-158`): JS native iff within ±(2^53−1) (`js-min-safe`/`js-max-safe`), Dart native iff `isValidInt` (int64), JVM long iff bitLength < 64; module kernels demote (`src/cljc/yin/vm/integer.cljc:171,308`), so `ints/value` answers canonical carriers. First fixture-order reject: `2^53` on Node, `2^63` on Dart — as the report states. All seven floats (incl. NaN/±0/5e-324) are `cbor/float64` carriers, accepted on every host.

